Skip sensor controls the driver does not offer

The AIQ sends digital gain, frame duration (VBLANK/HBLANK) and the test
pattern mode with every request. The IMX681 driver has no digital gain or
test pattern control and fixed, read-only blanking, so each frame logged
three or four SetControl errors (EINVAL, EPERM). Ask the driver once per
control and skip the write when it is absent or read-only; a test pattern
of "off" on a sensor without the control succeeds.

Surface Pro 12 (Intel), sp12-camera-hal.

diff --git i/src/core/SensorHwCtrl.cpp w/src/core/SensorHwCtrl.cpp
